# Local secrets: an API key lives here, never commit it.
.env

# The generated Android project is committed on purpose: it carries hand-written
# pieces (manifest permissions and intents, the release signing config, the share
# and notification handling in MainActivity) that `tauri android init` preserves
# but a fresh generation would not have. Build output, the keystore and the
# generated settings file stay out via src-tauri/gen/android/.gitignore.

# Gradle intermediates inside the vendored plugins; some artefact names exceed
# the Windows path limit and make `git add` fail outright.
plugins/*/android/build
plugins/*/android/.tauri
plugins/*/build

# Local notes that should not be published: what the neut/ui components are
# missing, written down while the workaround still lives in this repo.
*.local.md
